  "answer": "I can help with this, but I need to confirm which transaction it is. The earlier details of this conversation don't include the transaction ID, and I won't guess, since a dispute can't be undone once filed.\n\nYour recent transactions on ACC-1005 are:\n\n- **TX-0403**, 1 Sep 2026, CityParking, EUR 35.50, card, settled\n- **TX-0401**, 20 Jul 2026, TechMart Online, EUR 240.00, card, settled\n- **TX-0402**, 14 Jul 2026, TechMart Online, EUR 240.00, card, settled\n\nCould you tell me which one is the charge for goods that never arrived? If it's one of the TechMart payments, please confirm the date and amount so I'm sure it's the right one.\n\nOnce you confirm, the next steps are:\n\n1. I check whether the transaction is eligible for a goods-not-received dispute.\n2. If it is eligible, I show you the details and ask for your explicit go-ahead.\n3. Only after you confirm do I open the dispute.\n\nIf the check shows it isn't eligible, I'll tell you why and suggest the next step.",
